<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕcī^prŏcātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		reciproco. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a going back upon
				itself</i>, <i>a returning by the
				same way</i>, <i>retrogression</i> (postAug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aestus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the reflux. ebb</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 8, 9, § 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fili,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 24, 28, § 83</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caprorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					50, 76, § 201</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">errantium siderum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 14, 1, 23</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>alternation</i>, <i>reciprocation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">talionum,</span>”
				<i>retaliation</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 20, 1, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animorum,</span>”
				<i>the transmigration of souls</i>,
					<i>metempsychosis</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. ad Nat. 1, 19</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> In
			gram., <i>reciprocal action</i>, in the pron. recipr.,
					<i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 940</span></i> P.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
